# Tradewind DealFlow Phase 1 requires no runtime secrets or provider credentials.
# It is intentionally local-first and does not transmit workspace records.
#
# Future Phase 2 variables must remain unset until the named provider, data-use
# rights, security review, and applicable legal approval are documented.
#
# TRADEWIND_PRIMARY_DOMAIN=
# TRADEWIND_TARGET_AREAS=
# TRADEWIND_TARGET_PROPERTY_TYPES=
